{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55396","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 心印 · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 心印","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问君心印作何颜？心印何人敢授传？历劫坦然无异色，呼爲心印早虚言。\n须知本自灵（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「体自虚」）空性，将喻红罏焰（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「火」）里莲。\n莫以（《大正》本作「莫谓」、《偈颂》作「勿谓」）无心便（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「云」）是道，无心犹隔一重关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}